<!--
  Loaded only when com.intellij.modules.jcef is present (see the optional <depends>
  in plugin.xml). It contributes no extensions on purpose: its whole job is to make
  the dependency declared, so the JCEF plugin's classloader becomes a parent of ours
  and com.intellij.ui.jcef.JBCefApp is actually reachable.

  Without it the embedded dashboard cannot work on IntelliJ 2026.2+, where JCEF moved
  out of the platform into its own plugin: the classes ship with the IDE but are not
  in any plugin's graph unless that plugin asks for them.
-->
